[b]L-Systems vs Fractals vs Recursion[/b]

**How are these related?**

[color=yellow][b]Recursion:[/b][/color]
- **Code calls itself** (function invokes function)
- **Stack stores return addresses** (where to go back to)
- **Base case stops descent**

[color=yellow][b]Fractals:[/b][/color]
